direction: right
spec: Task Spec
planner: Planner Agent
progress: Progress File + Task List
generator: Generator Agent
sandbox: Sandbox + Tools
checks: Deterministic Checks
evaluator: Evaluator Agent
human: Human Review
spec -> planner: high-level goal
planner -> progress: decomposed tasks
progress -> generator: next task + prior context
generator -> sandbox: code and tool calls
sandbox -> checks: output
checks -> evaluator: passes rules
checks -> generator: rule failure
evaluator -> generator: feedback on fail
evaluator -> progress: mark done
progress -> human: status for steering
